      "area": "General",
      "position": 3,
      "content": "Each course on the student's program planner must be completed with a grade of 'C' or higher. In addition, a course in which a grade lower than 'C' is received must be retaken and successfully completed prior to enrolling in a course for which it is a prerequisite. Students must take COMM 200 in their first year of declaring their major. Consult the CSULB Catalog for additional details.",
      "contentHtml": "<p>Each course on the student's program planner must be completed with a grade of 'C' or higher. In addition, a course in which a grade lower than 'C' is received must be retaken and successfully completed prior to enrolling in a course for which it is a prerequisite.</p><p><br></p><p>Students must take COMM 200 in their first year of declaring their major.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Consult</strong> the <a href=\"https://csulb.catalog.acalog.com/preview_program.php?catoid=12&amp;poid=6279\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">CSULB Catalog</a> for additional details.</p>"
